<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.4 bln bond due 2007 yields 6.660 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.4 bln bond due 2007 yields 6.660 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.4 billion auction of 7.25 percent bonds due June 1, 2007 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     6.660     104.267  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     6.639     104.423  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    6.700     103.970   15.51646</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on May 15. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$9.5 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$4,953.25 million, including C$67.75 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
